  "plot_summary": "[HANG0] The letters page of [LINK:1963:FF_17|FF #17] concludes with this:&nbsp; <i>So, till next ish, read our mags, read our competitors' mags, but READ!&nbsp; It's one of the greatest pleasures of all!</i>\n\n[HANG0] It seemed like just about every book had something to the effect of \"Marvel Comics Group ushers in 'The Marvel Age of Comics'\" on the cover.",
